{"type":"post","id":47,"slug":"land-rover-defender-110","path":"\/land-rover-defender-110","title":"Land Rover Defender 110","content":"<p>Sur ce Defender, l&rsquo;am\u00e9nagement \u00e9pouse la caisse sans jamais la toucher : les meubles prennent appui sur un plancher ind\u00e9pendant, et le couchage se prolonge en tablette coulissante au-dessus des coffres.<\/p>\n<p>Les d\u00e9coupes \u00e0 lattes all\u00e8gent le plateau de plusieurs kilos sans rien perdre en rigidit\u00e9. Le contreplaqu\u00e9 a \u00e9t\u00e9 laiss\u00e9 clair pour renvoyer la lumi\u00e8re dans une cellule qui n&rsquo;a que deux petites baies.<\/p>\n","excerpt":"Am\u00e9nagement complet d\u2019un Land Rover Defender 110 avec toit relevable AluCab Icarus.","date":"2025-03-17T00:54:52+00:00","modified":"2026-09-04T01:51:31+00:00","thumbnail":{"id":500,"src":"\/media\/2026\/09\/2406-defender-amenagement-complet-01.jpg","mime":"image\/jpeg","alt":"Land Rover Defender 110 : Land Rover Defender 110, photographie 1 du reportage","title":"Land Rover Defender 110 \u2014 1","caption":"","width":1281,"height":1920,"sizes":{"medium":{"src":"\/media\/2026\/09\/2406-defender-amenagement-complet-01-200x300.jpg","width":200,"height":300},"large":{"src":"\/media\/2026\/09\/2406-defender-amenagement-complet-01-683x1024.jpg","width":683,"height":1024},"thumbnail":{"src":"\/media\/2026\/09\/2406-defender-amenagement-complet-01-150x150.jpg","width":150,"height":150},"medium_large":{"src":"\/media\/2026\/09\/2406-defender-amenagement-complet-01-768x1151.jpg","width":768,"height":1151},"1536x1536":{"src":"\/media\/2026\/09\/2406-defender-amenagement-complet-01-1025x1536.jpg","width":1025,"height":1536}}},"acf":{"section_de_textes":{"titre":"Le bois contre la t\u00f4le","premier_texte":"<p>Sur ce Defender, l&rsquo;am\u00e9nagement \u00e9pouse la caisse sans jamais la toucher : les meubles prennent appui sur un plancher ind\u00e9pendant, et le couchage se prolonge en tablette coulissante au-dessus des coffres.<\/p>\n<p